WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
On Ball 1, start the falling script with the green flag, show, and forever blocks.

00:08.000 --> 00:19.000
Inside forever, add glide. Use x -190 and y -180.

00:19.000 --> 00:31.000
Add an if block. Check whether y position is less than -179.

00:31.000 --> 00:43.000
Inside if, add hide, wait, and show in that order.

00:43.000 --> 00:55.000
Build the wait time with pick random 6 to 600 divided by tempo.

00:55.000 --> 01:04.000
At the bottom of if, add go to x -190 and y 143.
